    "body": "## What and why\n\nMeasure the complete donor-credit correction from #2065 on the exact original selected parent and unchanged fifteen-position, seventeen-reference, 380-guard development objective. This result-only delivery preserves the full negative and updates M2's live documentation. It changes no Rust or serving behavior.\n\n## Result\n\n**REJECT the candidate for promotion.** On merged execution source `4f7eee35b250b6d5bf9e250fc0ea00d356998695`, the corrected run performs 31 fresh backwards, 416 forced donor pools and 14,292 alternatives, accepting 956 changes. Conditional correctness is **9/15**, the same correct-position set as the separate legacy coupled negative; position8 changes between two wrong winners. All17 references, all380 guards and391 native reloads pass. Combined CE is2.277403894726836 versus legacy2.3306226779693264. Actual-nine/full512/fresh/multi-turn are NOT_RUN; accepted whole-answer8/512 is unchanged.\n\nSaved arithmetic verifies changed Prefix credit (104 aggregate sign reversals) and bitwise-identical factual Generate credit in all31 frames. It is not independent backward or native-score replication. The candidate report/config/runtime identities and all raw evidence are retained;608files/372,002,006 logical bytes are preserved with a complete archive inventory, fresh private-store download verification and iCloud checksum/index. Pod01y12cabmvmmnq was released and deleted; live status confirms0pods. The record includes two setup failures and their scoped repairs.\n\nNext, only after merge and cleanup: inspect this run's saved residual constructor decisions to distinguish missing target-winning proposals, objective/reference rejection, guard veto and later loss. No repeated fit or guard relaxation.\n\n## Checklist\n\n- [x] Exact delivery-head static/document checks run; pinned execution source CUDA build and16 focused tests passed. No Rust change in this delivery. Commands, scope and exact-head review posted before queueing.\n- [x] Research record: `docs/labs/full-donor-run-2026-10-09/README.md` with artifact/config/data, scoped numbers, decision and limitations.\n- [x] New newest-first current-state entry ending with **Next:**; peer's entry preserved verbatim during rebase.\n- [x] Stale-document search completed; README, STATUS, ROADMAP, crate README, current-state and earlier implementation record reconciled.\n- [x] Milestone remains in progress; STATUS/ROADMAP position updated. M2/#2028 bodies will receive merged result and next dependency after verified delivery.\n- [x] README training section updated in place for the now-measured mechanism result.\n- [x] `python3 scripts/check_claim_wording.py` passes.\n- [x] After merge: verify on fresh main, delete remote/local branch, remove owned worktree and preserved local duplicates, run hygiene, post one scoped M2 result.\n\nReferences #2030\n",
